  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed:\n- Reload now reflects the current state of the underlying sources: placeholders\nthat have become resolvable are added, and keys that no longer resolve are\nremoved. Previously these changes were missed on reload.\n- A reload is signaled only when a resolved value actually changes, so\nIOptionsMonitor consumers are no longer notified for no-op reloads.\n- Reloading a source now drops keys that were removed from it instead of\nkeeping their stale values.\n- Resources are now released in the correct order when the provider is disposed.\nChanged:\n- AddTemplatedConfiguration now validates the configured template delimiters and\nthrows ArgumentException when the start and end characters are equal, match the\nconfiguration key delimiter (':'), or are whitespace or control characters.",
